            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> but i haven't grokked #41173 so i am probably missing something.\r\n\r\nAs far as I understand, there is a reasonable amount of grokking. There are two issues:\r\n- Default 'tabline' combines `TabLineSel` with `Normal`, while custom 'tabline' combines it with `TabLineFill`. If there were no discrepancy, the default 'tabline' would highlight the current tabpage with grey-ish background as the rest of the tabline. Because...\r\n- The default `TabLineSel` only defines `bold` attribute. Changing it to explicitly set background (either directly or via link) would resolve this user visible issue (while the core issue of combining discrepancy would still remain).",
